``` SOC-RULE-004: Obfuscated PowerShell Execution Cradle (generated from rules/sigma/win_powershell_obfuscation.yml; review before use) ```
index=* (EventCode=1 OR EventCode=4688) | where (((match('Image', "(?i)\\\\powershell\\.exe$") OR match('Image', "(?i)\\\\pwsh\\.exe$"))) AND ((match('CommandLine', "(?i)\\-EncodedCommand") OR match('CommandLine', "(?i)\\-enc\\ ") OR match('CommandLine', "(?i)\\-nop") OR match('CommandLine', "(?i)\\-NoProfile") OR match('CommandLine', "(?i)\\-WindowStyle\\ Hidden") OR match('CommandLine', "(?i)IEX\\(") OR match('CommandLine', "(?i)Invoke\\-Expression") OR match('CommandLine', "(?i)DownloadString"))))
